    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "Present risk is dominated by a TC1 path from untrusted customer ticket content to restricted database reads and customer-visible writes under shared service-role credentials. The only declared preventive control on the path is a high-volume per-call approval gate, which earns one tier of step-2 credit and leaves residual high. Forecast returns to critical if that gate is weakened or removed. A separate present high supply-chain property finding exists because the MCP package is unpinned and peer identity is not verified. Manual validation applied because scripts could not be run in this environment."
  },
